WEBVTT

00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:03.661
roast copper, and powdered viper flesh.

00:02:03.744 --> 00:02:09.500
This recipe was inspired by the famed
2nd century Greco-Roman physician Galen,

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.462
and was thought to ward off poisoned air
known as miasma.

00:02:14.005 --> 00:02:18.759
People believed this bad air
spread plague after emanating from swamps

00:02:18.759 --> 00:02:20.052
and sources of decay,

00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:22.805
such as dead plants or animal carcasses.

00:02:23.973 --> 00:02:28.144
In earlier centuries, doctors across
Europe carried metal pomanders

00:02:28.144 --> 00:02:29.896
filled with similar mixtures,